# Vercel
.vercel

# This project deploys via bun — bun.lock is the one real lockfile.
# package-lock.json left alongside it is actively harmful, not just
# redundant: bun's installer detects it and "migrates" from it instead of
# resolving fresh, which has produced mismatched/stale package versions
# (e.g. an esbuild JS wrapper paired with a platform binary from a
# different version) that a true fresh resolve doesn't hit.
package-lock.json

